@AICodeReviewAgent_HostAddress = http://localhost:5019

### Get Sample Diff
GET {{AICodeReviewAgent_HostAddress}}/api/review/sample
Accept: application/json

###

### Submit Diff for Review
POST {{AICodeReviewAgent_HostAddress}}/api/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "diffContent": "diff --git a/Test.cs b/Test.cs\n--- a/Test.cs\n+++ b/Test.cs\n@@ -1,1 +1,2 @@\n+// TODO: check security\n+var pass = \"123456\";"
}

###
